@startuml
' Sequence: change a basket line (design 6a) - Inventory & POS System v0.20.4 (report, Lecture 5; redrawn 2026-10-12)
' Edit: paste into draw.io (Arrange > Insert > Advanced > PlantUML) or planttext.com
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  HeaderBackgroundColor #E6F1EE
}
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor White
  ParticipantBorderColor Black
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ActorBorderColor Black
  ActorBackgroundColor White
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEA
  BorderColor #C9B458
}
skinparam swimlaneWidth same
hide circle

actor Cashier
participant "New Sale page\n(browser)" as UI
participant "change_line_options()\n(app.py)" as C
participant "Basket\n(session)" as S
database "Database" as DB
Cashier -> UI : taps the Cafe Latte line in the basket
UI -> UI : the line opens: Hot / Iced, add-ons
Cashier -> UI : taps Sub Oat, then Done (shows the new price)
UI -> C : POST /sales/line-options (line, serving, add-ons, CSRF)
C -> S : is this line in the basket?
C -> DB : drink has options? serving and add-ons offered?
alt not valid
  C --> UI : message, nothing changed
else valid
  C -> C : new line key "product:serving:add-ons"\n(same as another line? join them)
  C -> DB : enough stock and ingredients for the whole new basket?
  alt short
    C --> UI : "Not enough Oat milk ..." (line unchanged)
  else enough
    C -> S : save the changed basket
    C --> UI : basket shows "Iced, Sub Oat", new total
  end
end
note over Cashier, UI
  The - and + buttons work the same way
  (POST /sales/line-quantity, only -1 or +1;
  "+" is checked against the stock, 0 removes the line).
end note
@enduml
